// After a Local's, a Static's or a parameter's name, or a function, a word
// is a type of TL++'s or a class the file declares; anything else is
// refused. A Data's and a method's return go to TL++ as they are.
Class Box
  Data oLid as Lid
  Method Open(oKey as Key) as Hinge
EndClass

User Function Pack(oItem as Item, oBox as Box) as Crate
  Local oWrap as Paper
  Local nN as Numeric
Return oItem
